"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nevertheless, his cooperation will undoubtedly be the easiest of the three to "
"gain. ⟪k:3⟫We were fortunate to run into him first."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫단……, ⟪k:3⟫멜이 가장 설득하기 쉬운 건 사실입니다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫멜을 맨 처음 만난 건 운"
"이 좋았죠."

